WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.240
- All right, everybody,
it's time for a toast,

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:03.073
but you know what?

00:00:03.073 --> 00:00:04.950
This can be a normal toast.

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.020
It can't be ordinary.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.840
This is a toast to Dwayne
Johnson, shape-shifter, demigod,

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.290
savior of the Kelly Clarkson
Show season one premiere.

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:13.546
Hit it, guys!

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:17.296
(upbeat marching band music)

00:00:22.352 --> 00:00:24.351
Oh, there's some red cards (indistinct).

00:00:24.351 --> 00:00:25.428
Okay, okay.

00:00:25.428 --> 00:00:28.095
(Kelly screams)

00:00:36.681 --> 00:00:38.431
All right, all right.

00:00:41.661 --> 00:00:44.244
Get it, get it, get it, get it.

00:00:54.153 --> 00:00:57.077
Oh my, that looks like a workout.

00:00:57.077 --> 00:00:59.660
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:12.002 --> 00:01:13.026
Oh, God.

00:01:13.026 --> 00:01:14.317
Oh!

00:01:14.317 --> 00:01:16.442
Oh, we got a crown.

00:01:16.442 --> 00:01:17.760
We got a crown.
- Oh, thank you.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:19.070
- There we go, we've got a crown.

00:01:19.070 --> 00:01:21.717
Now, what the hell just happened?

00:01:21.717 --> 00:01:23.835
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:23.835 --> 00:01:25.117
That was something.

00:01:25.117 --> 00:01:28.457
That's a parade that never ends.

00:01:28.457 --> 00:01:29.980
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:31.260
- Kelly, so, before we do,

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:33.720
first of all, I wanna say,
what a beautiful gesture.

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:35.490
Thank you so much for doing this, Kelly.

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:37.770
This was an amazing surprise.
- We love you.

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:38.603
- Thank you.

00:01:38.603 --> 00:01:40.240
And now, the world finally knows

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:41.950
what goes through my wife Lauren's head

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:43.480
after we have a sexy date night,

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:46.246
all of that stuff.
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:46.246 --> 00:01:48.187
- That's seven from "Friends."

00:01:48.187 --> 00:01:49.283
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:49.283 --> 00:01:50.116
That's amazing.

00:01:50.116 --> 00:01:53.860
All right, everybody,
let's raise our glasses,

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:58.860
here's to the man, the myth,
the best guy that's ever been.

00:01:59.108 --> 00:02:01.180
(upbeat marching band music)
What are you?

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:02.200
Are you serious?

00:02:04.963 --> 00:02:05.796
Oh my God.

